{
  "id": "MAT.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 10",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijasoodi damaniyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguursa giinealangaaschi atamaniyeenya, ak ghoadaw gheambalmeeda jea gooruuteawa meangeenda munyas nea ghoahaap geeyoonung'weaka ea sawanaduutka sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheawungeaba giijasoodisu atamaniyeenyean ea suh, dea madeeda Simoneeda siguura Betarohi ea orjeeda ghaamwat siguura Andreya, ea Yakobo orjeeda Sebedayo ea Yohana orjeeda ghaamwat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Filipo ea Bartolomayo, Domaso ea Matayooyda ghayi ang'oonyi gwaadi, ea Yakobo orjeeda Alfayo, ea Dadayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simoneeda Ganaani ea Yudayda Iskariyote ghayi laabwadaw Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giijeakteayda fuga atamaniyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeakta Yesu giijasoodigiga atamaniyeenyean ak ghoadaw giijasta nea gwayeesha, “Adooweayi jeeda darooraka Eemoojiga, ghana jeeda mujiineeda wassean bea Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'wana ghoang'waanyi naweeda aweayeena heeda gisilga roodeadi bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeeda neayeedeang'wa arukwiida gideaba, ‘Sugoocheanduumeeda humng'eeda nineekiit.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oahaabwa fuga miyeani, ak gootuudu fuga nimeewa, nea ghoamiidu fuga bearji udamusuura, nea gooruuti meangeenda. Geegooneegwa mwadaagha, oatayda mwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoayaadi jeesinga shageenigeagwa lapiya ghana dahaabu sisina lapiya wassean, ghana heelajeega, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana shageeda naweeda, ghana hang'deaba iyeenya, ghana geeka ghana bileangida. Aba gideaba siida gadiyeeda gammiisa nyasita daghwardaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyooweayi jeeda mujiineeda wassean ghana gharang'da, googasayi siida deaptaneegwa biissa ea doabiiwaat ak goopiidi gheanyi ea abeawana hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyooweayi jeeda gheeda gookeacheewi fuga bea gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheedida iimiisa hoyyooydeang'wa, abeeda danyasa hoyyooydeang'wa. Ama deepa ea mamiisiina abeeda hoyyooydeang'wa gaygabiikseegwa agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iimwadeaptaneegwa ghana ghaheawa gooleeysiit ng'asheegeagwa, iyooriteawi gheedida ghana mujiineedida, ghoalalakti birjeanda mida geeshangeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa geayeesheegwa eaweeda girgweaksiinda gajeawusus ng'eanyiida Sodoma ea Gomora gamilikghteaysa ghoorjooda eaweeda girgweaksiinda ea ghang'al mujiineedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghabasta jea ghwahidu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi Aniini geajeakteaydaneegwa gisilga jeeda suuyeeka; asi andeawana weaghuumeeda ea awuurjeewana ichibooda, nea goong'eeniiti ghariibajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashageada buuneeda aba gideaba gayghwaadeagwa gheeda siirgweacha nea ghabwareagwa aba jeesinga gealga nyaawa siinealshacheewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeayadeagwa madeeda sugoodiga ea dea fuga ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida aba badaydeanyu, ak goomuuwiisi Giijasta miy saawa ea fuga Eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iisiyaadeagwa adooteemsheesi gichea arukuta aba gideaba damandida gajeegooneegwa gichea arukuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba mii agooga gil fuga jea gabalool, gaygabalool Guroorooda Ghweandeang'wa aba jeesingeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida gayghwala bwadaw orjeeda ghaamwat eenuus, ak ghwalabadaw ghweanda jeaptaanyi, nea gwayamsa geat diibiga ghweaniga nyaawa ea gheamadiga nyaawa ak ghabwar gameewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gayghwasteagwa buuneassean aba gheawungeasu. Nea siichea ghamilikghta ea gamuudean abeeda ea siichea eelealu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iighabwaaseagwa buuneeda aba mujiineani, goomng'awsi mujiineanuut. Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa majaduulni mujiinajeega ng'eanyiida Israeli nea miighwahidu Orjeeda Siida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Giinealaneeda moamu ghang'al giinealshoocheandaanyi; nea eara soomjeanda ea moamu ghang'al siida haw adaw gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahit iiwuurji giinealaneeda sea giinealshoocheandaanyi, ak gawuurji soomjeanda sea siidaanyi haw bea gadiyeeda. Abeeda iisiguura siida bea gheeda Beelsebuli, heapi abeeda ea maygwasissa ng'asheega munyas muuchi fuga mida jeedeaba gheanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida miisa gheawalmeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi adoawali saawa aba gideaba ng'asheanda funyaat gajeajaat, nea gidida funyaadiin gajeatahaach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanda earukuneegwa aba jeeda misaneeda, oorukuta aba eeshpwara; nea ng'asheanda oayiinyi meang'shooda, arukwiida aba uhuuda gheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoawali fuga ammu gwanuus saseeda ak ea moamu gwanuus guroorooda; ghang'wana giiwali siidida ammu gwanuus saseeda ak gwajaksa guroorooda jeeda maloonghajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi udabwaraadaji iyeenya meesheahideawana heelajeanjagi? Eara akaleala moamu goobissa ng'eanyi nea mamwasa Ghweandeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea agooga eara buudeega iheengeagwa ea siyiida sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoabeali, agooga; ghoang'ali udabwaraadajeega saang'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Masaweega ea gissiheawaata Gristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida mwasan aba madeeda buuneeda, abeeda eara aniini gaydamwas niny aba madeeda Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea siida wassean jea ghaheawanaan aba madeeda buuneeda, eara aniini gaydaheawa niny aba madeeda Bwaabeeda mida humng'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Meayeani hoyyoo geayeadu ng'ucheeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adiidu ghoaghanyi gili eayeadu hoyyoo jeeda ng'eanyiida; meayeani hoyyoo geayeadu ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghaawunyi deang'uuchi siida ea ghwaan, ea huda ea ghaamwat, ea gatmooda ea ghamasiyeeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weajoodiga siida fuga gheanyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida bwariiy ghwaan ea ghaamwat ea ghwalaabwanaan hoowa siisi mamiisean; siida bwariiy orjeeda ghana huda ea ghwalaabwanaan hoowa, siisi mamiisean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea dea mwasara beehiidaanyi ak gweada geeshteanyu ea mamiisean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida agaba eaweagaaschi gaygahuteawi, nea siida huteawi eaweagaaschi aba badaydeanyu gaygwalealu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giimearda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida deaptaneegwa ghwadeaptanaan aniini, nea siida deaptanaan, ghwadeapta siida ghayi ajeaknean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siiteapta sibaneeda aba gideaba sibaneeda gil, gayghwanyas giimearda sibaneeda. Dea deapta siida doabiiwaat aba gideaba ea doabiiwaat eara niny gayghwanyas giimearda doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean jea ghoadaw siyagi aba jeedeaba fiisu manang'iin beega garbapi aba gideaba giinealaneeda, aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa eara niny mayghwaroat giimeardaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.10.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
